>\n                  <li>2.4GHz AP/CPE/Bridge/Repeater</li>\n                  <li>10 dBi Built-in directional Antenna</li>\n                  <li>Max. Data Rate: 300 Mbps</li>\n                  <li>1x 10/100 Mbps Ethernet Port</li>\n                  <li>Mounting (Outdoor/Indoor): Desktop, Pole, Wall</li>\n                  <li>18V Passive PoE Adapter</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>Altai C1n Super WiFi CPE/AP – High-Performance 802.11n Outdoor Access Point</b></h2><div><b>Boost Your WiFi Coverage with the Altai C1n – Long-Range, High-Speed, and Weatherproof</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>The Altai C1n Super WiFi CPE/AP is a high-performance, long-range 802.11n access point designed for outdoor and indoor deployments. Engineered with patented smart-signal processing technology, this device enhances WiFi signal strength, client throughput, and overall network stability. Whether used as a CPE for extending coverage or a standalone <a href=\"/networking/access-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">access point</a>, the Altai C1n provides up to 250m line-of-sight (LOS) coverage with dual slant ±45° antennas for optimized signal reception.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li><b>Superior Signal Strength – Patented smart-signal processing enhances performance in LOS &amp; NLOS conditions</b></li><li><b>Long-Range Coverage – Provides up to 250m WiFi coverage with a 10 dBi dual-slant sector antenna</b></li><li><b>Multi-Mode Functionality – Operates as a CPE, standalone AP, or repeater</b></li><li><b>Bandwidth Control &amp; User Isolation – Supports per-client/VAP bandwidth control and secure multi-user isolation</b></li><li><b>Remote Management – Web-based management with real-time client status monitoring</b></li><li><b>Weatherproof &amp; Durable – IP55-rated enclosure for outdoor deployments in extreme conditions</b></li><li><b>Easy &amp; Quick Installation – 8-level LED alignment for precise signal positioning</b></li></ul><h3><b>Technical Specifications:</b></h3><ul><li><b>Wireless Standard: 802.11b/g/n (2×2 MIMO) | Frequency: 2.4 GHz (2.400 – 2.485 GHz, Ch 1-13)</b></li><li><b>Max Transmit Power: 29 dBm (Max), 26 dBm per chain</b></li><li><b>Antenna Gain: 10 dBi Dual Slant ±45° Sector</b></li><li><b>Coverage: Up to 250m (LOS)</b></li><li><b>Network Interface: 10/100 Mbps Ethernet Port</b></li><li><b>Security: WPA/WPA2/WPA3, MAC-based access control, Dynamic VLAN Assignment, Firewall</b></li><li><b>Management: AltaiGate, AltaiCare, SSH, SNMP v1/v2c/v3, Web UI</b></li><li><b>Power Supply: 18V Passive PoE or 802.3af PoE (Adapter Required)</b></li><li><b>Power Consumption: 6W (Typical) / 8W (Max)</b></li><li><b>Operating Temperature: -20°C to +55°C</b></li><li><b>Certifications: FCC, CE, RoHS Compliant</b></li></ul><h3><b>What’s in the Box?</b></h3><ul><li><b>1x Altai C1n Super WiFi CPE/AP</b></li><li><b>1x Mounting Kit (Pole, Wall, or Window-Mounted)</b></li><li><b>1x Quick Installation Guide<br><br></b></li></ul><h3><b>Why Choose Altai C1n?</b></h3><ul><li><b>&nbsp;Ideal for Large-Area Coverage – Perfect for rural areas, warehouses, hotels, and outdoor environments</b></li><li><b>&nbsp;Robust &amp; Reliable – Handles wind speeds up to 200 km/h and extreme temperatures</b></li><li><b>Optimized for Wireless ISPs – Supports PPPoE, NAT, VLAN, DHCP, and Multicast Filtering</b></li><li><b>Seamless Network Expansion – Works with Altai Super WiFi Base Stations for large-scale connectivity</b></li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n        